<!--
  The group's business rules. One document for every repository in the group - backend,
  frontend, jobs, mobile. The rule is written once here and implemented in as many
  repositories as need it.

  This file answers "what does this product do and within which bounds". It never answers
  "how is it built": folder layout, frameworks, commands and architecture belong to each
  repository's CLAUDE.md. A rule kept in two places rots in one of them.

  Written for a reader with no context - a new teammate, or a model opening the group for
  the first time. Every rule carries its exact bound and the test that holds it, so a
  disagreement between this file and the code is decidable rather than debatable.

  Replace every {{PLACEHOLDER}} and delete what does not apply.
-->

